  (no_connect (at 279.4 144.78) (uuid "e5f89296-cc96-5618-8812-ebebd4551c14"))
  (text "Power: the switch common is the 3.3 V rail (XIAO 3V3 pin and the LEDs). Position 1 = badge 3.3 V feeds the rail. Position 2 (OFF) ties D1 to the rail; position 3 (USB) leaves the badge disconnected." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 96.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "57034742-49c3-549e-86c6-9484e099aeb8"))
  (text "On USB-BAT the XIAO powers the rail itself, from USB-C or the LiPo on J2 (charged by the XIAO). In OFF the firmware sees D1 high and blanks the LEDs (a sleep, not a hard cut, with a LiPo attached). No coin cell." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 100.33 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "52989388-3051-5925-b50e-29fed77ecbb8"))
  (text "Do not plug in USB with the switch on SAO while on a badge: two 3.3 V regulators would share one rail." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "f3a362d1-2ad1-5a33-980f-61bf63316e1d"))
  (text "D1..D4 = SK6805 side-firing RGB round the bottom of the helmet, chained D1 (right, seen from the front) to D4 (left), as on the original. C1 = 100 nF at the LEDs' supply." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 107.94999999999999 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "3e5fadbb-93a1-5838-9c07-d57c12b4158e"))
  (text "R2, R3: 330 ohm on the SAO GPIO pins per docs/standard.md. R1: 330 ohm on the LED data line. R4: 330 ohm in the OFF sense line (harmless; it lets the badge 3.3 V track cross it). R2, R3 and R4 each let one other track pass between their pads: the board is routed on the back copper only." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 111.75999999999999 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b4fbf614-3099-56b9-b890-8a03ff479bb9"))
  (text "The maker's two 10 k I2C pull-ups were dropped (the badge provides them; docs/standard.md section 1). Mode button = the XIAO's own BOOT button." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 38.1 115.57 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "27e29b39-fd28-5426-a6c5-8ba972dc9a58"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
